  run:["Do a small two-foot jump and land on both feet, holding the landing for two seconds.","Check knees over toes, hips back, chest up, heels down quietly.","Progress to a full block jump, then a spike-approach jump, holding each landing.","Finish with land-and-go reps: stick it, then take two quick shuffle steps away."],
  score:{ label:"quiet two-foot landings held for two seconds with knees in line, out of 15", attempts:15, target:13 },
